// Automaton keeper: the precursor guardian at each of the middle band's gates (GDR-0112; GDR-0026, GDR-0099 A7).
// A ring of four shielded pods round a heart, each pod joined to the heart by one bridge block and run by a core
// of its own (a cannon and a shield emitter, 5 of its 6 MW): the front two face forward, the rear two cover its
// back. The heart (three cores, a fusion reactor) carries two beam lasers between the front pods, two shield
// emitters and a torch drive. Shot off, a pod keeps turning on its own core and fires on; the heart fights on until
// its cores go dark or its beams are gone. PLACEHOLDER layout (content batch of 18 Oct 2026, tuned with the
// headless voyage runner, docs/results/picket-keeper-balance-2026-10-18.md). Not tagged `enemy`: the test range's
// waves keep to the rim's (GDR-0089).
